WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:05.980
In 1967, Lynn White Junior wrote in the
journal Science that Christianity helped

2
00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:08.460
cause the ecological crisis.

3
00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:13.990
His target: the command in Genesis to
have dominion over every living thing.

4
00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:19.610
In 1979, the scientist James Lovelock
pictured the earth as one self-regulating

5
00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:20.570
system.

6
00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.330
He called it Gaia.

7
00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:27.260
So are humans the earth's caretakers,
or just one part of a living planet that

8
00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:28.940
may not need us?

9
00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:33.040
In this mission, you'll see how
Christians read dominion as stewardship,

10
00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:35.040
and test White's charge.

11
00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:39.650
Then you'll meet a philosopher who
split ecology into shallow and deep.

12
00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:43.350
Your mission: weigh up whether
humans are the earth's caretakers,

13
00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:44.930
or just one part of it.
